@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@cronSecret = development-only-secret-change-me
@articleId = replace-me

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### News grid
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/news?mood=hopeful&limit=10

### Article detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/news/{{articleId}}?mood=concerned

### Manual rewrite
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/news/{{articleId}}/rewrite

### Ops
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ops/summary

### Ingest job
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/ingest
Authorization: Bearer {{cronSecret}}

### Rewrite job
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/rewrite-pending?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{cronSecret}}
